[E0414] Error: cannot assign to `slot` while an `is` binding refers to it
    ╭─[ err/579_a_binding_written_through_holds_its_place/main.wip:12:9 ]
    │
 10 │     if slot is .Some(counter) {
    │        ──┬─
    │          ╰─── tested here; the bindings refer to it
    │
 12 │         slot = .None
    │         ──┬─
    │           ╰─── assigned here
    │
    │ Note: a binding of an `is` test on a place that is written through is the place's field, so the place must not change until the block ends; one only read holds it to its last use
────╯
[E0414] Error: cannot borrow `names` as `&var` while a `for` loop walks it
    ╭─[ err/579_a_binding_written_through_holds_its_place/main.wip:18:32 ]
    │
 17 │     for name in names {
    │                 ──┬──
    │                   ╰──── walked here; the loop's binding refers to its elements
 18 │         if name.isEmpty() then names.clear()
    │                                ──┬──
    │                                  ╰──── borrowed here
    │
    │ Note: a `for` binding refers to the element itself, so what the loop walks must not change until the loop ends
────╯
